+  * @file    ftsError.c
+  * @brief   Contains all the function which handle with Error conditions
+  ******************************************************************************
+  * Copyright (C) 2016-2023, STMicroelectronics - All Rights Reserved
+  * Author(s): ACD(Analog Custom Devices) Software Team for STMicroelectronics.
